  "body": "Positioned on one of Auckland's most exclusive clifftop streets, 3 Hanene Street presents a rare opportunity to acquire an exceptional brand-new waterfront residence with breathtaking panoramic views across the Waitemata Harbour.\r\n\r\nDesigned and built to the highest standards of contemporary architecture and luxury, this remarkable new home enjoys a prized north-facing position, capturing sweeping vistas from Rangitoto Island to the Auckland Harbour Bridge.\r\n\r\nA home of this calibre combines timeless design, premium craftsmanship, privacy, and an unrivalled coastal setting, creating an exceptional lifestyle in one of New Zealand's most prestigious residential locations.\r\n\r\nSet across four beautifully appointed levels, the residence offers expansive living and entertaining spaces, five generous bedrooms and four beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a stunning master suite complete with its own private terrace, spectacular harbour outlook and spa-inspired ensuite.\r\n\r\nExceptional lifestyle features include a rooftop entertaining area, cinema, private office, internal lift servicing the upper levels, and a self-contained guest suite providing ideal accommodation for extended family, guests or staff.\r\n\r\nEvery element has been thoughtfully designed to deliver effortless everyday living while providing an exceptional setting for entertaining on both intimate and grand scales.\r\n\r\nThe landscaped grounds feature private pedestrian access to Tamaki Drive. Four-car garaging, including a separate Tamaki Drive-level garage, provides exceptional convenience for vehicle enthusiasts and secure storage.\r\n\r\nFrom sunrise across Rangitoto Island to the sparkling city lights each evening, the ever-changing harbour panorama provides a spectacular backdrop throughout every season.\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from St Heliers Beach, waterfront cafés, restaurants and some of Auckland's most sought-after schools, this residence offers an exceptional balance of privacy, convenience and world-class coastal living.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to acquire a residence of this calibre are exceptionally rare, offering a unique combination of architectural excellence, prestigious location and enduring value.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings are strictly by appointment.\r\n\r\nFor further information or to arrange a private inspection, please contact Brendan Goodwin on 021 278 7770 or brendan@uniq.nz.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: The technical information provided (including floor plans, floor area and land area) has been sourced from third-party organisations including Cotality, LINZ and Auckland Council. It is provided as a general guide only, and purchasers should undertake their own due diligence.",
